  "name": "From Hahn to Twirling in 60 Seconds",
  "description": "A short explainer, a perspective with an experimental proposal, and a reproducible finite-pulse Bloch-vector simulation that contrast Hahn-echo refocusing with an {I, X} channel twirl in a Ramsey sequence on the clock transition of a single 25Mg+ ion. All numbers are model predictions with illustrative parameters; the repository contains no measured data.",
